/* === ss-stream.jsx === */
/* StockSage · streaming answer engine (prompt 1).
   A server stream is modelled as ordered typed FRAMES:
     meta · token (prose delta) · block-start · block-data · block-end · done · error
   The player consumes frames on a timer and drives the UX:
   thinking → fade-in prose → typed skeletons → settle → finalize + disclaimer.
   Prose reveals as WORD-CHUNKS within already-structured paragraphs, so
   mid-parse markdown (half bold / half list) never flickers — we only ever
   slice the text of a paragraph we already know the shape of. */

